cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HSRI data or methodology, please cite as below."
type: dataset
title: "Human Superintelligence Readiness Index (HSRI)"
version: "0.3.0-dev"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
url: "https://krish-rm.github.io/hsri-research/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/krish-rm/hsri-research"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
abstract: >
  Exploratory benchmark assessing national cognitive absorption, discernment,
  and institutional resilience across 39 OECD and high-income partner nations.
  Not yet psychometrically validated. v0.2 uses institutional proxy indicators;
  direct behavioral measurement is planned for Phase 5 of the research roadmap.
authors:
  - name: "HSRI Research Team"
keywords:
  - AI readiness
  - human-AI interaction
  - cognitive discernment
  - automation bias
  - benchmark
  - superintelligence
